        "PMC5978046::chunk::001::introduction::a5a32da999"
      ],
      "same_system": "no"
    },
    {
      "text": "Al substitution may produce minor ordering, precipitation, or a B2-type phase.",
      "field": "structural_mediator",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "Replacing heavier constituents with low-density Al lowers the overall alloy density.",
      "field": "mechanism",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "entailed",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC5995863::chunk::001::introduction::a6c9e13965"
      ],
      "same_system": "no"
    },
    {
      "text": "BCC or B2-type phases formed through Al substitution will support mechanical stability at elevated temperatures.",
      "field": "mechanism",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "Higher entropy of mixing will help maintain strength and hardness from room temperature to elevated temperatures.",
      "field": "mechanism",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "partial",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC7513042::chunk::001::introduction::f13797f6f6",
        "PMC5978046::chunk::001::introduction::a5a32da999"
      ],
      "same_system": "no"
    },
    {
      "text": "Al substitution will refine the microstructure and thereby help retain mechanical properties.",
      "field": "mechanism",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "The intervention will reduce density by approximately 5–10% relative to 10.21 g cm−3.",
      "field": "predicted_outcome",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "The modified alloy will have comparable or slightly improved yield strength at room temperature and approximately 1000 °C.",
      "field": "predicted_outcome",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "partial",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC5995863::chunk::001::introduction::a6c9e13965"
      ],
      "same_system": "no"
    },
    {
      "text": "Keeping Al below 25 at% will prevent excessive formation of brittle or deleterious phases and retain good mechanical properties.",
      "field": "boundary",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
